<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-SUNDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SUNDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches on show courts at the French Open tennis championships on Sunday.</p>
<p>(matches start 0900 GMT)</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>Filip DeWulf (Belgium) v 8-Alex Corretja (Spain)</p>
<p>13-Irina Spirlea (Romania) v 2-Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) v Mark Philippoussis (Australia)</p>
<p>3-Monica Seles (U.S.) v 10-Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>Court A</p>
<p>7-Conchita Martinez (Spain) v 11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) v 15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v 16-Barbara Paulus (Austria)</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) v Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil)</p>
<p>Court 1</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) v Nicole Arendt (U.S.)</p>
<p>5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) v 9-Iva Majoli (Croatia)</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) v 6-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p> 12-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) v Lisa Raymond (U.S.)</p>
</text>
